WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.166
- Davante!

00:00:01.166 --> 00:00:03.166
- Aaron?
- Shhh. Listen.

00:00:03.166 --> 00:00:06.291
- "Today on Rogan, we're gonna talk
about spiders: Should you eat 'em?"

00:00:06.291 --> 00:00:09.625
- Please come back. You complet...ions me.

00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:10.791
- Is everything OK?

00:00:10.791 --> 00:00:13.041
- Go back to bed. We can't be losing sleep, too.

00:00:13.041 --> 00:00:14.666
- Does he take you to big games?

00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:15.958
- He takes up less cap space.

00:00:18.458 --> 00:00:23.750
- [Voiceover:] After a bad breakup, can this
perennial bachelor find a real catch?

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:28.083
- The trick is just to find a generational talent and then bury all the
annoying parts of your personality.

00:00:28.083 --> 00:00:30.500
- Kirk, drive me around.
- I'll try.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.458
- [Voiceover:] The heart only gives…

00:00:31.458 --> 00:00:33.875
- Blast them sides, Rodgers.
You look great!

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:35.666
- [Voiceover:] What it can receive.

00:00:36.708 --> 00:00:38.541
- Wrong route, you stupid a—

00:00:38.541 --> 00:00:39.708
- [Voiceover:] With Aaron Rodgers…

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:41.250
- What's your favorite part about the Pro Bowl?

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.666
- [Voiceover:] And, uh, Allen Lazard and some guys?

00:00:43.666 --> 00:00:45.583
- Never been.
- I'm Sammy Watkins.
- I dunno.

00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:46.708
- [Voiceover:] This fall…

00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:50.958
- Look, things change. I used to be a punter,
and now I'm a media darling. You need to be open.

00:00:50.958 --> 00:00:52.500
- They need to be open!

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.166
- [Voiceover:] Some missed connections…

00:00:54.166 --> 00:00:55.750
- [Together:] Why do you even want us back?

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:57.500
- So I can throw to ya any time I want.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:00.291
- [Voiceover:] Will make you wish you ran for it.

00:01:00.291 --> 00:01:02.083
- Goddamn it, guys! Keep your eyes open!

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:04.083
-[Voiceover:] Forgetting Davante Adams.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.000
-I'm just a quarterback standing in front of a receiver asking him to take a paycut for my sake.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:19.000
-And most of all, I hate the way these new guys don't catch the ball. Not even a little bit, not even at all.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.000
-I wish I knew how to quit you...and the Packers.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.000
-Nah, just the Packers. I mean, Jerry's been begging me to join the Cowboys.

